<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets $500 mln subordinated five-year bond.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets $500 mln subordinated five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers  ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABN AMRO BANK NV (CHICAGO)</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AMST/LUX  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 100     SALE LIMITS US/JP/SI/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND WHEN-ISSUED FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
